=2 Walkthrough
!Castle Oztroja (S)-map5.jpg|right|Oztroja (S) map 5
!Castle Oztroja (S)-map6.jpg|right|Oztroja (S) map 6
* Speak to {n:Dhea Prandoleh} for a cutscene.
* Examine the {p:Mithran Bivouac} in {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} (I-8) for another cutscene.
** This is just NE of the Recall-Meriph telepoint.
* Enter {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} for a cutscene.
* Farm three {i:Dorter Keys|Dorter Key|2567}, which drop from {m:Yagudo Eradicators|Yagudo Eradicator}, {m:Yagudo Knights Templar|Yagudo Knight Templar}, {m:Yagudo Prioresses|Yagudo Prioress}, and {m:Yagudo Prelates|Yagudo Prelate} found in {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} and inside {z:Castle Oztroja (S)}.
** You will need this for all characters that wish to complete this mission.
* Click the {p:Iron Grilles|Iron Grille} located in the outside areas of the second floor of the castle (see maps) until you receive a message stating that you sense someone on the other side.
* Trade the {i:Dorter Keys|Dorter Key|2567} to three of the {p:Iron Grilles|Iron Grille} with prisoners trapped inside.
** Each key is lost when trading, so be sure to examine the Grille before hand. If you trade the key to an empty cell you will not get a cutscene, and the key will be lost.
** Quest progress for freeing prisoners does not count towards other party member's progress.
*** There are two outdoor areas that hold prison cells. One located at E-7 and another at G-9
* After freeing three sets of prisoners, you will obtain a {@k}{k:Poet god's key} after the third cutscene.
* Head to the top of {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} and check the **Collapsing Floor** for a cutscene.
** The path up is the same as it is in present-day {z:Castle Oztroja}. See the full climb guide in the {k:Yagudo crest} segment of {q:Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind}. The only difference is that you will not be required to enter the Yagudo name Passwords at the top of the Castle.
* Examine the **Collapsing Floor** again to enter a BCNM.
* The fight is against {m:Tzee Xicu the Manifest} and 2x {m:Air Elementals|Air Elemental}.
** Elementals cast {s:Aeroga}, {s:Aeroga II}, {p:Silence}, and {s:Gravity}
** Tzee Xicu can use special TP move Kamitachi (full dispel and high damage, hate reset).
* Defeat {m:Tzee Xicu the Manifest} to continue.
** If you lose the fight, you must return to the {p:Mithran Bivouac} to re-obtain the {@k}{k:Poet god's key}.
** If you win the fight but have a {i:Hi-Reraiser|Hi-Reraiser|4173} in your inventory, you will be asked to pick up your reward at the {p:Mithran Bivouac}.

